  "reason": "closed-class particles and preverbs stored unaccented as the handbooks print them (an unaccented transcription is not evidence of an accentless word); the daughters accent them when they stand alone. The form is also the lex id (closed:particles/<form>), so an accented primary needs a plan/realize migration",
